sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant T as LINK Token
    participant V as Vault
    participant A as Aave Pool
    
    U->>T: approve(vault, amount)
    Note right of T: TX: 0x8bf93a7c...3f
    
    U->>V: depositByToken(LINK, amount)
    Note right of V: TX: 0x3e95c480...34
    
    V->>T: transferFrom(user, vault, amount)
    V->>A: supply(LINK, amount)
    A-->>V: Mint aLINK
    V-->>U: Update shares
